            "id": 146714,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pomiń blok kodu pętli while, ustawiając warunek na <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start match!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update and render&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Match ended!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby uruchomić pętlę, przypisz wartość <code>true</code> do <code>isPlaying</code> poza blokiem kodu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPlaying === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 146716,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skąd wiemy, że ta pętla się nie zatrzyma?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isGameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing background music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ponieważ zmienna <code>isGameRunning</code> nie aktualizuje się do wartości <code>false</code> wewnątrz bloku kodu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ponieważ żadna pętla <code>while</code> się nie zatrzymuje</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ponieważ zmienna <code>isGameRunning</code> aktualizuje się do wartości <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ponieważ zmienna <code>isGameRunning</code> nie aktualizuje się do wartości <code>false</code> wewnątrz bloku kodu.</p></body></html>"
          },
